.RI "class \fBRCUStream< TStream >\fP"
.br
.RI "A Read-Copy-Update (RCU) wrapper around a Stream that provides lock-free read operations and exclusive write operations\&. Reader activity is tracked through an \fBEpoch\fP, while writers are synchronized using an \fBILock\fP\&. This ensures deterministic behavior in concurrent read/write scenarios without requiring external synchronization\&. "
.in -1c
